---
import { DOWNLOAD, REPO } from "../lib/site";
---

<section id="install">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Install</p>
    <h2>Whether your Mac can run it</h2>

    <div class="split">
      <div class="reqs">
        <dl class="req">
          <dt>Works on</dt>
          <dd>
            Apple Silicon <strong>laptops</strong> running macOS 13 or later — M2 and
            later, plus M1 Pro and M1 Max.
          </dd>

          <dt>Has no sensor</dt>
          <dd>
            The M1 MacBook Pro (2020), the M1 Air, every desktop Mac and every Intel Mac.
            <code>yamete probe</code> says so plainly rather than hanging.
          </dd>

          <dt>Asks for</dt>
          <dd>
            Input Monitoring, on first launch. macOS gates all HID access behind it,
            including a motion sensor that is not an input device in any useful sense.
          </dd>
        </dl>

        <div class="cta">
          <a class="btn" href={DOWNLOAD}>Download the DMG</a>
          <a class="btn btn--ghost" href={DOWNLOAD}>Checksums</a>
        </div>
        <p class="mono fine">
          Signed and notarised · Apple Silicon · open the DMG and drag it across
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="cli">
        <h3>Or just the daemon</h3>
        <p>
          It runs happily without the app, which is how the detector was developed. A user
          LaunchAgent keeps detection running with nothing on screen.
        </p>
        <pre><code><span class="c"># is the sensor there, at what rate, decoding correctly</span>
yamete probe

<span class="c"># live detections, with the five detector scores</span>
yamete watch --scores

<span class="c"># run it permanently, independent of the app</span>
yamete install --copy</code></pre>
        <p class="src">
          Everything — the detector, the corpus and the tuning tools — is at
          <a href={REPO}>github.com/chipcolate/yamete</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .split {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 320px), 1fr));
    gap: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .req {
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
  }

  .req dt {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.58rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    padding-top: 0.9rem;
    border-top: 1.5px solid var(--ink);
  }

  .req dt:not(:first-child) {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
  }

  .req dd {
    margin: 0.4rem 0 0;
    max-width: 46ch;
  }

  .cta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .fine {
    margin-top: 0.9rem;
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .cli h3 {
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .cli p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .cli pre {
    margin: 1.25rem 0;
  }

  .src {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
</style>
